# Local development. NEVER commit real values - .env and .env.* are gitignored.
#
# Which key is which, because Supabase renamed them and the old names are still everywhere:
#   sb_publishable_...  public by design, browser-facing, constrained by row-level security.
#                       Formerly "anon". Safe to expose; used only to sign a user in.
#   sb_secret_...       BYPASSES row-level security entirely. Formerly "service_role".
#                       Worker secrets and the Supabase dashboard, nowhere else, ever.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
